---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout>
	<div class="column-container">
		<div class="column">
			<section>
				<h2 class="subtitle">About Us</h2>
				<p>
					The Burlington Chess Club hosts weekly chess tournaments
					every Tuesday at 7 PM (with pairings posted by 7:30). The
					tournaments are CFC rated and span five rounds, with one
					round per week. The time control is 60 min + 30 sec bonus.
					We also host rapid and blitz tournaments throughout the
					year.
				</p>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="subtitle">Location</h2>
				<a
					target="_blank"
					href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Wellington+Square+United+Church/@43.3311781,-79.7974956,120m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x882c9e2611e3b0ff:0xeedabac47797a553!8m2!3d43.3311045!4d-79.7970849!16s%2Fg%2F1tl4dp3t?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDkwNy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D"
				>
					Wellington Square United Church 2121 Caroline Street,
					Burlington, Ontario, L7R 1L7
				</a>
				<p>
					Entrance is from the parking lot in the rear.
					<br />
					The playing area is in the gym in the middle of the building.
					<br />
					Casual play is in the Music Room across the foyer.
				</p>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="subtitle">Joining the Club</h2>
				<p>
					Your first night of casual or competitive chess is on us!
					Feel free to come out any Tuesday night after 7 PM and we’ll
					pair you in the current tournament or against another casual
					chess fan. We ask that all players show up no later than
					7:15 to allow us to post the pairings promptly for 7:30. Not
					sure if you want to commit to playing? That’s okay too! Come
					out, see the club and talk to our players.
				</p>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="subtitle">Annual Membership</h2>
				<p>
					The annual membership covers all of the 5 round classical
					tournaments, as well as the rapid and blitz events held
					throughout the year.
				</p>
				<ul class="membership-list">
					<li><strong>$150</strong> per year</li>
					<li>
						<strong>E-transfer:</strong>{" "}
						<a href="mailto:burlingtonchess@gmail.com"
							>burlingtonchess@gmail.com</a
						>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</section>
		</div>
		<div class="column">
			<section>
				<h2 class="subtitle">Casual Players Welcome</h2>
				<p>
					If you are newer to chess or not interested in playing
					competitively, our casual chess section will be perfect for
					you! Each night of casual chess costs only $5. Play against
					other newer players or challenge existing club members, all
					while expanding your chess knowledge.
				</p>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="subtitle">CFC Membership</h2>
				<p>
					In order to play in rated tournaments, a CFC membership is
					required:
				</p>
				<ul class="membership-list">
					<li>CFC Membership - Adult = $48/year</li>
					<li>CFC Membership - Junior = $32/year</li>
					<li>
						<a
							href="https://www.chess.ca/en/players/membership-fees/"
							>https://www.chess.ca<wbr />/en<wbr />/players<wbr
							/>/membership-fees/</a
						>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="subtitle">Tournament Rules</h2>
				<ol>
					<li>
						You must keep score of both your moves and your
						opponent’s moves (optional in rapid/blitz)
					</li>
					<li>
						If you touch a piece, you must move it (if it's legal)
					</li>
					<li>
						If you touch an opponent's piece, you must capture it
						(if it's legal)
					</li>
					<li>
						You must castle with one hand, moving the king first
					</li>
					<li>
						You must make your move and press the clock with the
						same hand
					</li>
					<li>
						Your move is not complete until your clock has been
						pressed
					</li>
					<li>
						You must not talk, make noise, or disturb your opponent
						(or anyone else)
					</li>
				</ol>
			</section>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.wrapper {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		min-height: 100vh;
	}

	.column-container {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.column {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 50rem) {
		.column-container {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1rem;
		}
	}

	.membership-list {
		list-style: none;
	}

	.title {
		padding-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.subtitle {
		padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
</style>
